# Performance

Follow Vercel `react-best-practices` when writing or reviewing React/Next code.

- Eliminate waterfalls: `Promise.all` independent reads; cheap sync checks before `await`.
- Keep GSAP/Lenis/R3F out of the initial server graph. Dynamic-import below-fold scenes.
- No barrel imports from animation or 3D barrels.
- Animate transform/opacity only. No `transition: all`.
- LCP: `next/image` + `priority` + `next/font`. Claim height in CSS before motion.
- Defer analytics until after hydration.
- Cap DPR on Canvas. Pause off-screen WebGL (`frameloop="demand"` or visibility).
- `content-visibility` for long work lists. Do not layout-read in render.
- Target: INP healthy, CLS ~0, LCP from a real image/font, 60fps scroll on mid-tier laptops.